Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Graded sphere: tensors and orbits of a sphere with density \[Rho](1 + \
\[CurlyEpsilon]z)\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"b7eac146-2864-4402-a514-afe67be44052"],

Cell["\<\
Free-molecule response tensors, steady states, righting dynamics, and \
interactive simulations\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"600eb2d2-48c9-4d36-9939-67522a8cc3ab"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A sphere of radius ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[ScriptL]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4e9f077b-a786-49aa-90c9-8fdb2aaa0ceb"],
 " whose density varies linearly along one body axis, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "(", 
    StyleBox["r",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], ")", " ", "=", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", "p"], "(", "1", " ", "+", " ", "\[CurlyEpsilon]", " ",
     "z", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "78d95715-7d3d-4c28-8740-88dd5c6ea800"],
 ", is geometrically still a perfect sphere. Every gas\[Dash]surface stress \
therefore acts about its geometric centre H. The density gradient only moves \
the centre of mass (CoM) off H and changes the inertia tensor. This notebook \
derives what that implies, using the corrected surface-element stress of the \
notes (v22, Eq. 50) as the only physical input."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0cfff869-7c65-45f6-8df6-b7e0cd0885a8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Results in brief.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (1) About the CoM the particle has isotropic thermophoretic and drag \
tensors, plus three new blocks: an antisymmetric thermophoretic torque ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], 
     StyleBox["th",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], " ", "=", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "0"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"[", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["r",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "H"], "]"}], "\[Times]"]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"95cc7e86-cb46-4676-9a26-c9fce10f746f"],
 ", an antisymmetric translation\[Dash]rotation drag coupling, and a \
parallel-axis correction to the rotational drag. Here ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], "H"], " ", "=", " ", "-", 
    SubscriptBox["z", "c"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox["e", "^"], "3"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "24e59d68-e4a1-4396-b60e-b31c4e2caf04"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["z", "c"], " ", "=", " ", "\[CurlyEpsilon]", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[ScriptL]", "2"], "/", "5"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"a5f4d9a3-b018-4363-afe2-1e35857d3b5a"],
 ". This is exactly the polar class ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["C", 
    RowBox[{"\[Infinity]", " ", "v"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6448c780-dcaf-4606-a95e-d816d84010ec"],
 " of the notes' Eq. (29a), with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "a"], " ", "=", " ", "-", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "0"], 
    SubscriptBox["z", "c"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "98358b19-8e8b-488e-a293-7a2e6e9275d9"],
 ". (2) The torque rights the particle heavy side down, with stiffness ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"M", "g", 
    SubscriptBox["z", "c"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a74a89d9-c9e2-4c16-aa5e-8ee484c74051"],
 ", like a damped pendulum. (3) ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["T",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], 
    StyleBox["th",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6583d741-c2be-4927-a3f8-167b8dfad487"],
 " has no real eigenvector with non-zero eigenvalue, so there is ",
 StyleBox["no steady spin and no circular orbit",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": the particle levitates and hovers. (4) The righting happens about the \
force centre: H moves during the swing but ends exactly where it started, \
while the CoM swings underneath it and ends lower by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["z", "c"], "(", "1", " ", "-", " ", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", "0"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "49be1242-af31-4a09-9339-604a4b66ab75"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{3, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.35, 0.55, 0.85],
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.96, 0.97, 1.],ExpressionUUID->"2a020b57-a25e-46f1-bead-a8927423f7b8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Setup", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"a91f66bc-c4d1-4bdf-b4bb-e3575cebda00"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"$verifications", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"record", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ref_", ",", "claim_", ",", "status_", ",", "detail_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
      RowBox[{"$verifications", ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"ref", ",", "claim", ",", "status", ",", "detail"}], "}"}]}], 
      "]"}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"VR", "[", 
      RowBox[{"ref", ",", "claim", ",", "status", ",", "detail"}], "]"}]}], 
    ")"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"VR", "/:", 
   RowBox[{"MakeBoxes", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"VR", "[", 
      RowBox[{"ref_", ",", "claim_", ",", "status_", ",", "detail_"}], "]"}], 
     ",", "fmt_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"ToBoxes", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Panel", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
             RowBox[{"status", ",", "Bold", ",", 
              RowBox[{"If", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"status", "==", "\"\<VERIFIED\>\""}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"Darker", "[", "Green", "]"}], ",", "Red"}], "]"}]}], 
             "]"}], ",", "\"\<   \>\"", ",", 
            RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
             RowBox[{"ref", ",", "Bold"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<:  \>\"", ",", 
            "claim"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"detail", "===", "\"\<\>\""}], ",", "Nothing", ",", 
           "detail"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "fmt"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"check", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ref_String", ",", "claim_String", ",", "test_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"detail_", ":", "\"\<\>\""}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"record", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ref", ",", "claim", ",", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "test", "]"}], ",", "\"\<VERIFIED\>\"", 
       ",", "\"\<DISCREPANCY\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "detail"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", "expr_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", "expr", "]"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
     "PossibleZeroQ"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sci", "[", "x_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"x", "==", "0"}], ",", "\"\<0\>\"", ",", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"e", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Floor", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Log10", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
            RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
         RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], "/", 
            RowBox[{"10", "^", "e"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"3", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "<>", "\"\<e\>\"",
         "<>", 
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "e", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"num", "[", "x_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
    RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"5", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"hat", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"a1_", ",", "a2_", ",", "a3_"}], "}"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"0", ",", 
       RowBox[{"-", "a3"}], ",", "a2"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"a3", ",", "0", ",", 
       RowBox[{"-", "a1"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "a2"}], ",", "a1", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"quatR", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"q0_", ",", "q1_", ",", "q2_", ",", "q3_"}], "}"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"q0", "^", "2"}], "-", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"q1", ",", "q2", ",", "q3"}], "}"}], ".", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"q1", ",", "q2", ",", "q3"}], "}"}]}]}], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"2", 
     RowBox[{"Outer", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Times", ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"q1", ",", "q2", ",", "q3"}], "}"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"q1", ",", "q2", ",", "q3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"2", "q0", 
     RowBox[{"hat", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"q1", ",", "q2", ",", "q3"}], "}"}], "]"}]}]}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Qmat", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"q0_", ",", "q1_", ",", "q2_", ",", "q3_"}], "}"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "q1"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"-", "q2"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"-", "q3"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"q0", ",", 
       RowBox[{"-", "q3"}], ",", "q2"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"q3", ",", "q0", ",", 
       RowBox[{"-", "q1"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "q2"}], ",", "q1", ",", "q0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Zhat", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"e3", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"$Assumptions", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"l", ">", "0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"rho0", ">", "0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"al", ">", "0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"hh", ">", "0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"kap", ">", "0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Tk", ">", "0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"0", "<", "aa", "<=", "1"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "<", 
      RowBox[{"eps", "l"}], "<", "1"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Element", "[", 
      RowBox[{"zc", ",", "Reals"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",Express\
ionUUID->"784327cf-63e5-46c9-84ec-7cecd888602d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Mass properties", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"2ab4ba1b-bc1b-4671-bf26-f9bf88ce1721"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Measure body coordinates from the geometric centre H. The density ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", "p"], "(", "1", " ", "+", " ", "\[CurlyEpsilon]", " ",
     "z", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b0b01340-e4b5-420f-a5b0-599cb5b670f2"],
 " stays positive as long as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"|", "\[CurlyEpsilon]", "|", "\[ScriptL]", " ", "<", " ", "1"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"4b7005c1-bec8-4361-9022-e8a36858916e"],
 ". Odd moments of the sphere vanish, so the mass is unchanged and the CoM \
moves along ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox["e", "^"], "3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0bc9bc1a-6322-4264-ae77-d3dd9ee1a801"],
 " by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["z", "c"], " ", "=", " ", "\[CurlyEpsilon]", "\:3008", " ", 
    SuperscriptBox["z", "2"], "\:3009", " ", "=", " ", "\[CurlyEpsilon]", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[ScriptL]", "2"], "/", "5"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"5bbd3630-544e-44d8-b17c-bd0ac46ab41c"],
 ". The inertia about H is also unchanged, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["2", "5"], "M", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[ScriptL]", "2"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["I",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], "3"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4de11a69-a7ec-4647-b837-67d20ef3c8a0"],
 ". About the CoM, the parallel-axis theorem lowers the two transverse \
moments."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b1352d1f-c938-463a-a029-da7489decb00"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"rho", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r_", ",", "th_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"rho0", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", 
      RowBox[{"eps", "r", 
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "th", "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sphInt", "[", "f_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Integrate", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"f", 
      RowBox[{"r", "^", "2"}], 
      RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "th", "]"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"r", ",", "0", ",", "l"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"th", ",", "0", ",", "Pi"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"ph", ",", "0", ",", 
       RowBox[{"2", "Pi"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Mass", "=", 
   RowBox[{"sphInt", "[", 
    RowBox[{"rho", "[", 
     RowBox[{"r", ",", "th"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"com", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sphInt", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"rho", "[", 
       RowBox[{"r", ",", "th"}], "]"}], "r", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "th", "]"}], 
         RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "ph", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "th", "]"}], 
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "ph", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "th", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "/", "Mass"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"inertiaH", "=", 
   RowBox[{"sphInt", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"rho", "[", 
      RowBox[{"r", ",", "th"}], "]"}], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"r", "^", "2"}], 
          RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "-", 
         RowBox[{"Outer", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Times", ",", "#", ",", "#"}], "]"}]}], "&"}], "[", 
       RowBox[{"r", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "th", "]"}], 
           RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "ph", "]"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "th", "]"}], 
           RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "ph", "]"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "th", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}],
   ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"inertiaCoM", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{"inertiaH", "-", 
     RowBox[{"Mass", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"com", ".", "com"}], 
         RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "-", 
        RowBox[{"Outer", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Times", ",", "com", ",", "com"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<M = \>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", "Mass", "]"}], "]"}], 
       ",", "\"\<,   CoM = \>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", "com", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<I(H) = \>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", 
        RowBox[{"MatrixForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", "inertiaH", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
       ",", "\"\<     I(CoM) = \>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", 
        RowBox[{"MatrixForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", "inertiaCoM", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
     "]"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<mass\>\"", 
      ",", "\"\<M = (4/3) pi l^3 rho0, independent of eps\>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Mass", "-", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"4", "/", "3"}], "Pi", 
         RowBox[{"l", "^", "3"}], "rho0"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<CoM\>\"", 
      ",", "\"\<CoM displaced by z_c = eps l^2/5 along e3\>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"com", "-", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", 
          RowBox[{"eps", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"l", "^", "2"}], "/", "5"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], 
    ",", 
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<inertia\>\"", 
      ",", "\"\<inertia about H unchanged; about CoM the transverse moments \
drop by M z_c^2\>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{"inertiaH", "-", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", "/", "5"}], "Mass", 
          RowBox[{"l", "^", "2"}], 
          RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], "&&", 
       RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{"inertiaCoM", "-", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"2", "/", "5"}], "Mass", 
            RowBox[{"l", "^", "2"}], 
            RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "-", 
           RowBox[{"Mass", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"eps", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"l", "^", "2"}], "/", "5"}]}], ")"}], "^", "2"}], 
            RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", "0"}], "}"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}], 
        "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"31b0954d-\
49f6-40b9-b8f8-18268870228b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[{"\"M = \"", 
   TagBox[
    FormBox[
     RowBox[{
       FractionBox["4", "3"], " ", "\[Pi]", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["l", "3"], " ", "rho0"}], TraditionalForm], 
    TraditionalForm, Editable -> True], "\",   CoM = \"", 
   TagBox[
    FormBox[
     RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"eps", " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["l", "2"]}], "5"]}], "}"}], TraditionalForm], 
    TraditionalForm, Editable -> True]},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"0ecd26f2-2cb6-4c62-8f4e-\
027e447d3ecc"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[{"\"I(H) = \"", 
   TagBox[
    FormBox[
     TagBox[
      RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", 
        GridBox[{{
           RowBox[{
             FractionBox["8", "15"], " ", "\[Pi]", " ", 
             SuperscriptBox["l", "5"], " ", "rho0"}], "0", "0"}, {"0", 
           RowBox[{
             FractionBox["8", "15"], " ", "\[Pi]", " ", 
             SuperscriptBox["l", "5"], " ", "rho0"}], "0"}, {"0", "0", 
           RowBox[{
             FractionBox["8", "15"], " ", "\[Pi]", " ", 
             SuperscriptBox["l", "5"], " ", "rho0"}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, 
         ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> 
         Center], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], 
      Function[BoxForm`e$, 
       MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]], TraditionalForm], TraditionalForm, Editable -> 
    True], "\"     I(CoM) = \"", 
   TagBox[
    FormBox[
     TagBox[
      RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", 
        GridBox[{{
           RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", 
               FractionBox["4", "75"]}], " ", "\[Pi]", " ", 
             SuperscriptBox["l", "5"], " ", "rho0", " ", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                   SuperscriptBox["eps", "2"], " ", 
                   SuperscriptBox["l", "2"]}], "-", "10"}], ")"}]}], "0", 
           "0"}, {"0", 
           RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", 
               FractionBox["4", "75"]}], " ", "\[Pi]", " ", 
             SuperscriptBox["l", "5"], " ", "rho0", " ", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                   SuperscriptBox["eps", "2"], " ", 
                   SuperscriptBox["l", "2"]}], "-", "10"}], ")"}]}], "0"}, {
          "0", "0", 
           RowBox[{
             FractionBox["8", "15"], " ", "\[Pi]", " ", 
             SuperscriptBox["l", "5"], " ", "rho0"}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, 
         ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> 
         Center], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], 
      Function[BoxForm`e$, 
       MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]], TraditionalForm], TraditionalForm, Editable -> 
    True]},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"9844fcd4-d25e-4b81-8f95-\
20f21d059992"]
}, Open  ]],

